## 11/2/2024
## 1. added unachieved-desireds-count to desireds. This is tested in an MEA proposal (currently only goto/approach) with a constant 1 so do learn 
##    to apply goto whenever it can achieve a desired. Only when it is the last one.
##    Generatl calculation for unachieved-desireds-count for 1, 2, 3 desireds count. Can example to more (4, 5, 6)
##    Might need to add tests for it (such as 1, 2) for other MEA proposals. In that case, can use gp with [ 1 2 3 4 ] to generate multiple rules so the right 
##    number is tested. This is a hack as it will get the constant ( 1 2 3) into a chunk whereas if you did << 1 2 3 >> it would get the disjunction which wouldn't 
##    necessarily be correct.

