#Action Format Example
#(I3 ^perform-action P1)
#  (P1 ^name |action name here| ^args here…)
#The list of action names are here: https://github.com/Center-for-Integrated-Cognition/ITL-Thor/blob/master/RobotConnector.py
#L189. Some of them require arguments. For example, the “pick-up” command requires an “object” argument containing the handle (unique ID) of the object to be picked up.
